control: The application server serves TLS when given a key pair, read from its mounted files on each handshake, and a pair that does not load refuses the start
removes: the key pair is not loaded before the process serves, so a process whose mounts cannot serve starts and answers no handshake
packages: ./process
tests: TestAKeyPairThatDoesNotLoadRefusesTheStart
scheduled-count: no

diff --git a/process/serve.go b/process/serve.go
